  "question": {
    "text": "The average speed of $\\mathrm{H}_2$ at $T_1 \\mathrm{~K}$ is equal to that of $\\mathrm{O}_2$ at $T_2 \\mathrm{~K}$. The ratio $T_1: T_2$ is",
    "image": null
  },
