  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\left(\\mathrm{C}_{\\mathrm{av}}\\right)_{\\mathrm{H}_2}=\\left(\\mathrm{C}_{\\mathrm{av}}\\right)_{\\mathrm{O}_2}$\n$\\sqrt{\\frac{8 \\mathrm{RT}_1}{\\pi \\mathrm{M}_{\\mathrm{H}_2}}}=\\sqrt{\\frac{8 \\mathrm{RT}_2}{\\pi \\mathrm{M}_{\\mathrm{O}_2}}}$\n$\\therefore \\frac{\\mathrm{T}_1}{\\mathrm{~T}_2}=\\frac{\\mathrm{M}_{\\mathrm{H}_2}}{\\mathrm{~N}_{\\mathrm{O}_2}}=\\frac{2}{32}=\\frac{1}{16}$",
